          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac16&=1\\div6\\\\\\frac16&=0.1666\\ldots\\\\\\frac16&=0.1\\dot6\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivision gives 1 tenth with remainder 4; every subsequent digit is 6 with remainder 4.",
